        {
          "exampleId": "w:relevant#e-941ae445ae71fc23",
          "text": "Often students come to the classroom believing that learning can’t be fun and that what they learn isn’t relevant to the real world – much less to their personal interests.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2026-zhejiang-jan",
            "paperTitle": "2026年1月普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语试卷",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2026-zhejiang-jan:reading-b",
            "locator": {
